+    c.  **Eikonal Propagation:** If `_doEikonel` is true:
+        *   Fetch neighbor minimums:
+            $$ u_x = \min(|\text{sdf}(id + (1,0,0))|, |\text{sdf}(id - (1,0,0))|) $$
+            $$ u_y = \min(|\text{sdf}(id + (0,1,0))|, |\text{sdf}(id - (0,1,0))|) $$
+            $$ u_z = \min(|\text{sdf}(id + (0,0,1))|, |\text{sdf}(id - (0,0,1))|) $$
